  m_text: "Red bar- health - basic statistic, if you go below zero you DIE. You can
    heal using bandage\n\nGreen bar - infection level - infection deals damage per
    time/per tick. You need to lower it as close to zero as possible - using antidote\n\nYellow
    bar - stamina - \r\r                                      Stamina is consumed
    by attacking, jumping, and sprinting. It's better to use it well.\n\nPurple bar
    (top right) - EXP - showing you how many exp need too level up. After leveling
    up u can spend exp points in skill tree [P]"
